%% EVT-001; scope: consistency and event delivery; FR-DOC-002, FR-PUB-002, FR-COM-001, FR-FIN-001. SOURCE NOT RENDER-VALIDATED.
%% Legend: solid = local transaction or action; dashed = async at-least-once event; D = dead-letter; R = reconciliation.
flowchart LR
 Cmd[Idempotent command with expected version] --> TX[Local transaction: domain change + outbox]
 TX --> DB[(Domain database)]
 TX --> OB[(Versioned outbox)]
 OB --> Relay[Outbox relay]
 Relay -.-> Q[Durable event queue]
 Q -.-> Consumer[Consumer with inbox and unique event key]
 Consumer --> State[(Consumer state and audit)]
 Consumer -.->|retry with backoff| Q
 Consumer -.->|poison or exhausted| DLQ[D: dead-letter queue]
 DLQ --> Ops[Operator investigation]
 Provider[Payment provider] -.->|verified webhook| Consumer
 Reconcile[R: scheduled reconciliation] --> Provider
 Reconcile --> State
 Reconcile --> Ops
